#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0210 expect=noViolation domain=ADSL
#note "MECHANISM PIN - authored dotted applicability guard. NO DM block at all. With DM absent the KeyMatchRowExpander skips the join entry (rows kept) and `var_exists(DM.ARM)` resolves FALSE via the DatasetResolver -> the rule EXECUTES and reports nothing (noViolation, NOT skipped). This is the guard the machine derivation does not supply (dotted operand) - the author wrote it, and this fixture is what it buys."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 0
dataset ADSL structure=ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ARM     type=Char
---
S1 | 01-701-1015 | DRUGA
S1 | 01-701-1023 | PLACEBO
